id: dense-armor
name: Dense Armor
kind: crafting
categories: armor
slots: 1
# "Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT)" - this piece's, wherever its Bonus is read.
apparelBonus: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Apparel Bonus 1(bT) higher, and Combat Rolls 1(bT) lower.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT) but reduce your Combat Rolls by an equal
  amount.
text: >
  Dense Armor: Particularly protective armor, this bulky gear restricts your movements.
  –Apparel Category: Armor
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT) but reduce your Combat Rolls by an equal
  amount.

---

# The Bonus is the Apparel's own: its sheet shows it 1(bT) higher, and whatever reads it - the
# Armor's Damage Reduction, a Doff Bonus - reads that. The Combat Rolls are the wearer's, while
# worn: the Strike, the Dodge and the Wound Roll.
[passive]
combatRolls -= 1(bT);
